The DRAFTMAN PDF.pdf document provides manufacturing-oriented information for the THEJAS32-Based FPV Flight Control and Navigation System.

The top-side and isometric views present the component arrangement, while the copper-layer view provides a visual representation of PCB routing. The BOM documents the components and their quantities. The realistic 3D model supports mechanical inspection, and the drill table documents the hole sizes and plating information required for fabrication.

